  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MatrixOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to the Matrix open protocol (used by Element, Synapse, etc.). Maps Matrix users to OASIS Avatars and room events (messages) to OASIS Holons. Supports any homeserver via MATRIX_HOMESERVER env var. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Implement bounded Matrix room-alias CQL source and C# demo (3588270)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Social/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MatrixOASIS",
